00:00:04,547 --> 00:00:16,579
Calculate then compare value of a + b and b + a

3
00:00:20,486 --> 00:00:29,397
We have: a = 5.7; b = 6.24

4
00:00:29,783 --> 00:00:42,880
Calculate: a + b = 5.7 + 6.24 = 11.94

5
00:00:45,151 --> 00:00:58,097
b + a = 6.24 + 5.7 = 11.94.

6
00:01:00,428 --> 00:01:09,304
So: a + b = b + a = 11.94.

7
00:01:10,562 --> 00:01:12,224
Conclusion:

8
00:01:13,308 --> 00:01:36,679
Addition has commutative property: When swapping two addends in a sum, sum does not change.

